/*
Every grouping of three and/or operators on four boolean variables, with
not around one or more of its groups (the whole expression or a grouped
part), each as a value and as an if condition, for all 16 combinations of
true and false (a first). A not starts a separate true/false test inside
the expression, so its group's short-circuit jumps must stay inside it.
This file holds 140 of the 280 expressions; the rest are in
NotGroupingsOne. Expected output worked out separately.
*/
class Main
    action Main
        Show("not ((a or b) and (c and d))", 0)
        Show("not (a or b) and (c and d)", 1)
